<div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose-stack">
  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="gameplay">
    <h2 id="gameplay">Gameplay help</h2>
    <p>New to Rollabop? The <a href="/how-to-play/">How to Play</a> guide explains everything in seven short cards.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Take your time.</strong> There is no clock. Study the pile before you move.</li>
      <li><strong>Any ball can move.</strong> Even one buried at the bottom of the pile.</li>
      <li><strong>Think one step further.</strong> Watch where the balls above a match will fall. That is where cascades begin.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="technical">
    <h2 id="technical">Technical issues</h2>
    <p>If Rollabop is not behaving as expected, these steps often help:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Close Rollabop completely, then open it again.</li>
      <li>Make sure your device and the app are up to date.</li>
      <li>Restart your device.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>If the problem continues, please contact us. It helps to include your device model, Android version, Rollabop version, and what happened.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="saving">
    <h2 id="saving">Saving &amp; progress {{ ui.tag("Coming before release") }}</h2>
    <p>Details on how Rollabop saves your progress, and what happens when you change devices, will be published here before release.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="purchases">
    <h2 id="purchases">Purchases {{ ui.tag("Coming before release") }}</h2>
    <p>Rollabop's optional purchases are still being designed. Information on buying, restoring and refunds will be published here before any purchases are offered.</p>
    <p class="muted">Our commitment: every level can be beaten by a thoughtful player without paying and without watching an ad.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="accessibility">
    <h2 id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
    <p>If anything in Rollabop is hard to see, hear, read or play, we want to know. Your feedback shapes the accessibility options we build next.</p>
    <p>Read about <a href="/#access-title">our accessibility direction</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel panel--contact" aria-labelledby="contact">
    <h2 id="contact">Contact support</h2>
    {%- if site.supportEmail %}
    <p>Email us and we will get back to you as soon as we can.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.supportEmail }}?subject=Rollabop%20support">{{ site.supportEmail }}</a></p>
    {%- else %}
    <p>A support contact will be published here before Rollabop's release.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>
</div>
